# Nutts
tags: heroes, benchmark
stimulus: Seven-movement chipper finishing with a run holding a plate.
note: Wall ball target 10 ft (men) / 9 ft (women). The original posting gives men's loads only; the women's loads are the commonly used ones.
For time
  10 Handstand push-up
  15 Deadlift 250/175 lb
  25 Box jump 30/24 in
  50 Pull-up
  100 Wall ball 20/14 lb
  200 Double-under
  400 m Plate carry 45/35 lb
